---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Manage the Anthropic and OpenRouter API keys used for Claude models

Usage: mxr llm key [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  set     Store a key read from stdin (never from an argument, so it stays out of shell history and process listings)
  status  Show which providers have a key and where it comes from (never the key)
  remove  Delete a stored key
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>  [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
